<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from the first</p>
<p>day of the South African Open at the par 72 Glendower course on</p>
<p>Thursday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>65 Wayne Bradley</p>
<p>66 Ernie Els, Fulton Allem, Ian Woosnam (Wales), Thomas</p>
<p>Bjorn (Denmark)</p>
<p>67 Eamonn Darcy (Ireland)</p>
<p>68 Olle Karlsson (Sweden), Jean Van de Velde (France),</p>
<p>Steve Woods (U.S.), Per Haugsrud (Norway), Gary Evans</p>
<p>(England)</p>
<p>69 David Gilford (England), Jamie Spence (England),</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji), Wayne Westner, Wally Coetsee,</p>
<p>Fran Quinn jnr (U.S.), Michael Archer (England),</p>
<p>Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe), Nico van Rensburg, David</p>
<p>Carter (England)</p>
</text>
